      "content": "10. Catalysts"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Respiration is classified as an exothermic reaction, while photosynthesis is endothermic.",
        "Flushing packaged chips with inert Nitrogen gas prevents rancidity by blocking oxidation.",
        "Rusting of iron requires both oxygen and moisture, forming hydrated ferric oxide (Fe2O3·xH2O).",
        "Catalysts alter the chemical reaction speed without being consumed in the process."
      ],
      "id": "bbiz2sr"
